  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Circular Solutions to Plastic Pollution (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PPG Circular Solutions to Plastic Pollution in Costa Rica.The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Circular Solutions to Plastic Pollution in Costa Rica. As described in the project child project concept note, the project main objective is to reduce the amount of plastic that the food and beverage industry put on the market and incentivize them to implement circular solutions to plastic packaging</narrative>
  </description>
